<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings - AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings - AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		 Pct Change	 Week Ending:</p>
<p>    -		From Year Ago  06/14/97   06/15/96</p>
<p> Grain		     7.1	 23,207     21,670</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   3.2	  9,690	9,388</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  14.2	  1,871	1,639</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	  -4.5	 21,494     22,506</p>
